      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hideout%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hideout lies in the Wasatch Mountains, an area well known for its upscale recreation and ski resorts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
